["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The FCC&#x27;s New Robot Rules covered list conditional approval blue UAS list bad labs onshoring plan\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-06-chinatalk-fcc-用一份笨规则-把中国机器人挡在门外/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1a805ef1f2e186f3-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">51:44</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">ChinaTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0806</span></div>\n<h2>FCC 用一份笨规则，把中国机器人挡在门外</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">FCC 把移动机器人列入 covered list，新机型一律不能进口。理由不是技术多先进，而是供应链依赖越晚解决越难，所以宁可要简单粗暴的规则，也不要精雕细琢的豁免。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">机器人</span><span class=\"tag\">出口管制</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"贾扬清：我所经历的「人工智能已死」到「AI 颠覆世界」的数年巨变丨串台「声东击西」S10E24 Caffe AlexNet Agent FAIR\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-06-whatsnext-单个智能体再强也成不了团队-ai需要生产关系/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/98eaf4baa4b6920b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"W\"><span class=\"dur\">2:10:08</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">科技早知道</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0806</span></div>\n<h2>AI没杀死工作，Agent团队才是真瓶颈</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">贾扬清从Caffe到两次创业，复盘AI十五年：模型能力已经够用，瓶颈在怎么让一群Agent像人类团队一样协作，他还断言AI没带来大规模裁员，只是替罪羊。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI</span><span class=\"tag\">创业</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Chasing Trillion-Dollar Companies, Founder Ambition, Token Budgets, and Regulatory Capture with Sarah &amp; Elad punctuated equilibrium RSI ROIT regulatory capture exit tax\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-06-nopriors-三位万亿公司五年内出现-但下一个不会这么快/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d8446c4650e10d7e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">39:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">No Priors</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0806</span></div>\n<h2>三位万亿公司五年内出现，但下一个不会这么快</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">五年内三家从零到万亿美元市值是历史异常，不是新常态。真正稀缺的不是大市场，而是能在五年内跑到 500 亿美元收入的速度。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">风险投资</span><span class=\"tag\">创始人退出</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Barry Ritholtz: How Not to Invest | Rational Reminder 421 halo effect Gell-Mann amnesia Sturgeon&#x27;s Law decumulation ESOP\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-06-rationalreminder-亿万富翁的经济预测-和短视频里的理财建议一样不可信/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d88279cd5f22a944-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:40:34</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Rational Reminder</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0806</span></div>\n<h2>亿万富翁的经济预测，和短视频里的理财建议一样不可信</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">光环效应让人把成功者的所有话当洞见，但他们在自己领域之外同样一无所知；好建议谦卑且概率化，坏建议自信且具体。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>14</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">投资</span><span class=\"tag\">行为金融</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Weight Loss: Why Won&#x27;t It Stick? weight cycling visceral fat macrophage\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-06-sciencevs-体重循环不毁代谢-健康行为比体重重要/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a3282246c3202bd6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">39:39</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Science Vs</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0806</span></div>\n<h2>溜溜球节食不毁代谢，健康习惯比体重更决定寿命</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">体重循环（溜溜球节食）不会永久破坏代谢，普通人的反弹增重很少造成肌肉流失；真正影响健康和寿命的是健康习惯本身，不是体重的上下波动。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">体重循环</span><span class=\"tag\">减肥</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Brad Setser on the US&#x27;s Unusual Japanese Yen Intervention FIMA Repo Facility ESF Primary Balance Carry Trade Big Mac Index\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-06-oddlots-美国为何联手日本干预日元-新工具与旧逻辑/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">42:00</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0806</span></div>\n<h2>美国联手日本干预日元：卖欧元而非美元，赌日本央行加息</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美国财政部罕见联手日本干预日元，卖出欧元而非美元，并动用 FEMA 回购工具。Brad Setser 认为，只要日本央行加息，干预就能奏效，且日本财政状况远好于美国。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>2</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">日元</span><span class=\"tag\">外汇干预</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The economics of putting germicidal light in every room, with Misha Gurevich and Vivian Belenky of Aerolamp far UVC krypton chloride excimer lamp ASHRAE 241 R0 hygiene hypothesis\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-06-complexsys-222纳米杀菌灯便宜有效-缺的是认知而非技术/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7fc764da6acb74e8-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:16:20</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Complex Systems</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0806</span></div>\n<h2>222纳米灯杀菌有效却一年只卖几百台，瓶颈不是技术</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Far UVC 用 222 纳米光在空气中灭活病原体，对人体表层无害；南非 TB 试验已看到 90% 抑制，但全世界一年只卖几百台。真正瓶颈是认知扩散。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">far UVC</span><span class=\"tag\">空气传播疾病</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Julia Ioffe on Russian Women, Missing Men, and the Roots of Autocracy woman question single sex family gender essentialism pronatalist policy steam valve\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-05-tyler-苏联把女人炼成超人-把男人宠成废物/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3096d9c0d3a4a23d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">55:14</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Conversations with Tyler</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0805</span></div>\n<h2>苏联把女人炼成超人，把男人宠成废物</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">二战后2700万苏联人丧生，男人成了稀缺资源；国家用堕胎禁令、婚外生育奖励和家暴非刑化把女人锻成超人，把男人宠成废物，这套秩序至今支撑普京的父权动员。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">俄国社会</span><span class=\"tag\">性别政治</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"E247｜对话盛颖：xAI，Infra的浪漫，SGLang，开源，平权与“甄嬛传” SGLang RadixAttention KVCache Miles day zero one year cliff\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-05-sv101-xai-最美好的时代-为什么留不住她/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cfe8fa9f8e3fa476-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"硅\"><span class=\"dur\">1:46:26</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">硅谷101</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0805</span></div>\n<h2>xAI 最美好的时代，为什么留不住她</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">盛颖把 xAI 早期称为 v1.0：不到 100 人、没有 politics、同时给她 support 和 freedom。她为了 SGLang 社区提前两个月离开，放弃一年 cliff 的 vesting。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI Infra</span><span class=\"tag\">开源</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"美国无人驾驶20年兴衰：天才、小偷、叛徒，从沙漠到法庭的大冒险 DARPA L3 激光雷达 founder mode\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-04-cnf65bb3-自动驾驶真正的难关不是技术-是最后那-5-的意外/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ac2c4de6938cb713-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"科\"><span class=\"dur\">2:34:39</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">科技这碗饭</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0804</span></div>\n<h2>自动驾驶真正的难关不是技术，是最后那 5% 的意外</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1995 年一辆奔驰就自动跑完了 1758 公里高速，95% 的里程机器早就会开；可只要剩下 5% 的意外还在，驾驶座上就必须留一个人，司机的工资一分钱都省不下来。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">自动驾驶</span><span class=\"tag\">DARPA</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Big Tech&#x27;s Hidden Debt Problem off-balance-sheet vehicle vendor financing big market delusion incomplete revelation hypothesis limits of arbitrage\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-04-patrickboyle-表外债务不是欺诈-真正的风险是没人读脚注/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2eb71149af422d0e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"P\"><span class=\"dur\">32:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Patrick Boyle</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0804</span></div>\n<h2>AI 巨头表外债务不是欺诈，是没人读脚注</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">所谓 1.65 万亿美元隐藏债务并不是 Enron 式欺诈，而是未投运数据中心的长租与采购承诺，合法但埋在脚注里；真正危险的是 AI 巨头靠互相融资和调整后收益讲故事。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 资本开支</span><span class=\"tag\">表外债务</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"What the hell happened with AGI timelines in 2026? – Rob Wiblin RLVR METR ECI GDPval Vending-Bench 2 AI Village\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-04-eightythousand-agi-时间线提前一年-但脏活仍是瓶颈/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a7038cb60f3d75b6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"8\"><span class=\"dur\">49:28</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">80,000 Hours</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0804</span></div>\n<h2>AI 收入年增 700%，但脏活任务仍差人类 6 倍</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">2026 年 AI 进展证据：收入爆炸、编码智能体成熟，但脏活任务仍差；时间线缩短约一年，但长期仍存变数。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AGI</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 智能体</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"283: ENCORE: Best of Ask Lisa: Friendship Breakups &amp; Conflict relational aggression queen bee blame the parent two-faced\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-04-asklisa-友谊破裂是成长章节-不是人生判决/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ace27132dfc1e3aa-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">23:42</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Ask Lisa</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0804</span></div>\n<h2>被朋友群踢出不是判决：那是化学键在加固</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">孩子被朋友群排挤，或要主动结束一段友谊，都是青春期的正常章节；家长最该做的是给孩子视角和具体话术，而不是代替他冲进去。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">青春期</span><span class=\"tag\">友谊</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"178: Ubiquiti least privilege VPN kill switch MAC address\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-04-darknetdiaries-ubiquiti-内鬼自导自演勒索比特币-败在自家路由器/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e2627fbdeaef9327-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">36:12</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Darknet Diaries</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0804</span></div>\n<h2>年薪 25 万美元仍嫌少，他自导自演勒索自家公司</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Ubiquiti 云团队负责人觉得年薪 25 万美元还不够，自导自演入侵公司、索要 25 比特币，结果被自家路由器记录的 MAC 地址锁定，判刑六年。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">内鬼攻击</span><span class=\"tag\">企业勒索</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Inference Engineering Masterclass — Philip Kiely &amp; Ali Taha, Baseten speculative decoding (spec dec) PD disaggregation NVFP4 mega kernel expert parallelism KV cache compaction\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-03-latentspace-量化更多层反而更准-因为误差会互相抵消/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/23103bc773bd5837-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:41:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0803</span></div>\n<h2>量化更多层反而更准：误差会互相抵消</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">选对层之后，量化更多反而更保真——误差会互相抵消；同理 10 倍加速不是单点突破，而是量化、speculator、PD 分离各翻一倍叠出来的。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">推理优化</span><span class=\"tag\">量化</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"The Political Economy of Palestine (with Hussein Aboubakr Mansour) autopoietic symbolic convertibility machine UNRWA teshuvah\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-03-econtalk-巴勒斯坦不是民族事业-而是自再生的政治经济榨取机器/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f8da698e33560635-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">1:27:41</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">EconTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0803</span></div>\n<h2>巴勒斯坦不是民族事业，是台自再生的符号榨取机器</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">别再把巴勒斯坦当作单一民族事业——在中东权力结构里，它是一台把苦难转成各方资产的符号机器：没有中心、没有可杀的国王，只能通过个人意义上的清醒破局。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中东政治</span><span class=\"tag\">寻租经济</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Tungsten Market Is Warning of an Upcoming War Ammonium Paratungstate (APT) Dry Metric Ton Unit (DMTU) Tungsten Carbide Ionic Absorption Clays\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-03-oddlots-钨价暴涨背后-一场百年战争预测市场/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">44:26</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0803</span></div>\n<h2>钨价暴涨是百年战争预测市场：中国断供即翻十倍</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">钨的供需周期像战争预测市场：战前暴涨、战后崩盘。中国控制八成供应，西方重启旧矿仅需数千万美元，却因缺乏期货市场而难以融资。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">钨</span><span class=\"tag\">关键矿产</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"Re-release: Raising an Entrepreneur (Without Taking Over Their Business) Roth IRA unschooling sliding scale pricing guide on the side intake form\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-03-parentmojo-给孩子最大的财务礼物不是大学基金-是让她10岁创业/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/70c340acb32275d2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"Y\"><span class=\"dur\">1:00:19</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Your Parenting Mojo</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0803</span></div>\n<h2>给孩子最大的财务礼物不是大学基金，是让她10岁创业</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">10岁孩子靠宠物托管赚到759美元退休金，这不是提前鸡娃，而是用真实责任练出系统思维、边界感、坚持和财务自由。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">儿童创业</span><span class=\"tag\">财务启蒙</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"50 - Eli Lifland on AI 2027 research taste uplift time horizon research stock indexical sandbag\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-02-axrp-ai-2027-作者-对齐下一代-ai-ai-比人省一千倍力气/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/912f9695220a1820-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">2:40:40</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">AXRP</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0802</span></div>\n<h2>AI 2027 作者：对齐下一代 AI，AI 比人省一千倍力气</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI 2027 里人类对齐超级智能千难万险，agent 4 对齐下一代却几乎一次成功——Eli 承认这个不对称是真的，AI 自己动手至少省一千倍认知量。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 对齐</span><span class=\"tag\">智能爆炸</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Jordan talks AI with Sebastian Mallaby on his show &#x27;The Spillover&#x27; open weights distillation alignment tokenomics frontier lab\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-01-chinatalk-美国要慢可以-但得把中国开源一起管住/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/94fa934f85ccd79f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:20:03</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">ChinaTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0801</span></div>\n<h2>美国管制自家AI没用，除非连中国开源一起管</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美国若只管制自家前沿模型、不压制中国开源模型，安全逻辑不成立；真正的胜负手是算力存量和交付能力。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中美 AI 竞争</span><span class=\"tag\">开源权重</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"270.大厂押注AI办公，飞书和钉钉却先成了配角 Agent ARR CAPEX GEO\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-01-luanfanshu-飞书钉钉退场-ai办公的主角成了个人agent/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/490e0c935e82c209-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"乱\"><span class=\"dur\">1:37:09</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">乱翻书</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0801</span></div>\n<h2>飞书钉钉退场，AI办公主角成了个人Agent</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">飞书被并入豆包、钉钉让位千问办公，企业IM历史使命终结；AI办公的核心从组织协同转向个人生产力，coding能力成为Agent底座。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI办公</span><span class=\"tag\">飞书</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"E246｜何谓蒸馏？聊聊硅谷如何看中国开放模型逼近前沿 logits scaling efficiency KV cache harness Exploit Bench\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-01-sv101-开源模型追平闭源-蒸馏指控站不住脚/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cfe8fa9f8e3fa476-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"硅\"><span class=\"dur\">1:07:12</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">硅谷101</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0801</span></div>\n<h2>开源模型追平闭源，蒸馏指控站不住脚</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">K3 与 Fable 发布只隔约 15 天，蒸馏在时间上根本来不及；真正让闭源实验室焦虑的是模型从垄断品变成流通商品，估值体系要重算。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">开源模型</span><span class=\"tag\">蒸馏</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Building an Autonomous Enterprise for Real-World Services with Netic Founder Melisa Tokmak roll-up essential services harness vaporware\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-07-31-nopriors-ai-只用来砍成本-是件很可悲的事/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8e65a40709afebff-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">34:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">No Priors</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0731</span></div>\n<h2>AI 只用来砍成本，是件很可悲的事</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Netic 创始人 Melisa Tokmak 说，私人股本见她的第一面永远先谈降本，但她真正卖的是让这些公司赚到净新增收入——她的客户已因此多赚 6 亿美元。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">垂直 AI</span><span class=\"tag\">企业销售</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Arsenic and Lace: The Trial of the Yorkshire Witch - with Maddy Pelling pleading the belly bottle conjurer ill wishes / well wishes\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-07-31-cautionary-约克郡女巫罪案-骗局的核心是权力欲/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b996da73a08744ac-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">43:31</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Cautionary Tales</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0731</span></div>\n<h2>女骗子死后被解剖示众：她威胁的不是钱，是秩序</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">18世纪女骗子玛丽·贝特曼以算命和毒饼行骗，不图钱财而享受掌控。她的骗术精准命中人性渴望，死后仍被解剖展示，揭示社会对秩序颠覆者的恐惧。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">骗局</span><span class=\"tag\">心理操控</span>\n</div></div></a>"]